    <name>
      <text>11.2 Linear equation fraction</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>Here is an equation to be solved:</p>
<p>\( \displaystyle {@(aa*x+bb)/p@}+{@(cc*x+dd)/q@}={@right@}\)</p>
<p>(a) Multiply every term by the same number(s) to remove the fractions. Write down the left and right hand sides of the equation that you obtain.</p>
<p>[[input:ans1]] \(=\) [[input:ans2]][[validation:ans1]][[validation:ans2]][[feedback:prt1]]</p>
<p align="right"><b>(2)</b></p>
<p>(b) Solve the equation.</p>
<p>\(x=\)[[input:ans3]][[validation:ans3]][[feedback:prt3]]</p>
<p align="right"><b>(2)</b></p>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
